    "end": 15.167,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So good evening, everybody.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_1",
    "start": 15.187,
    "end": 16.608,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Very happy to be here in New York.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_2",
    "start": 45.722,
    "end": 72.673,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "something looks like a spaceship I've never given talk in a spaceship before so I'm really happy to be here because many people that I met before when I came with Khyentse Rinpoche",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_3",
    "start": 74.292,
    "end": 81.338,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "in 1975 and then a few times after, so many old friends.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_4",
    "start": 82.539,
    "end": 86.182,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So we are all, how do you say, getting a little bit older.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_5",
    "start": 88.269,
    "end": 103.776,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And here in audience I see maybe like four different generations of Buddhists in America, so I'm a little bit not sure how to talk.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_6",
    "start": 105.297,
    "end": 116.62,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "because some of you are maybe more senior than me in studying Buddhism, and some of you are quite new.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_7",
    "start": 116.66,
    "end": 124.223,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Myself, usually, I don't travel much giving teaching or lecture in the West.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_8",
    "start": 125.163,
    "end": 131.005,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Mostly I'm staying in Nepal and Bhutan, taking care of the monastery,",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_9",
    "start": 134.737,
    "end": 152.198,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Well, I think I spent 20 years of my life with the previous Khyentse Rinpoche, like he mentioned, since I was three maybe, till 25 when Khyentse Rinpoche passed away.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_10",
    "start": 153.403,
    "end": 164.994,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Then after that, searching for the reincarnation and preparing for the arrival of the Khyentse Rinpoche's reincarnation.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_11",
    "start": 165.675,
    "end": 171.761,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And once we found the reincarnation, another 20 years serving the young Khyentse Rinpoche.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_12",
    "start": 173.142,
    "end": 194.859,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I feel very, very fortunate to be able to spend a long time with such a great master like Khyentse Rinpoche for 20 years and being with Khyentse Rinpoche that I got chance to meet so many of the great masters",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_13",
    "start": 198.371,
    "end": 214.101,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "like His Holiness 16th Karmapa, the 14th Dalai Lama, and many, many senior masters, they always come and visit, or Khyentse Rinpoche go and visit them, so I always feel very, very fortunate and very lucky.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_14",
    "start": 214.961,
    "end": 223.847,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And same, many of our friends here, many of the senior students, I think we should always not to forget that how lucky we are.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_15",
    "start": 224.933,
    "end": 237.895,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "to meet such great masters, realized masters who came from Tibet and then all the way to America and to teach.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_16",
    "start": 237.955,
    "end": 244.136,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So many of us, very, very fortunate to be able to meet them.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_17",
    "start": 244.156,
    "end": 252.678,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I sometimes tell Western friends that why Tibet had so many great masters",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_18",
    "start": 254.201,
    "end": 273.296,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "It's because if you look in the Tibetan situation in Tibet, out of the 6 million Tibetans, more than 10% Tibetans focus became monks and lamas and practicing.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_19",
    "start": 273.716,
    "end": 278.019,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So out of which, then Tibet produced many, many great masters.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_20",
    "start": 280.181,
    "end": 282.363,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Just like Brazilian,",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_21",
    "start": 283.361,
    "end": 288.769,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "out of so many population they come up the world's best 12 football players.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_22",
    "start": 290.232,
    "end": 298.044,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I think in Tibet all the population is out of maybe all the population 10",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_23",
    "start": 299.105,
    "end": 303.891,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "more than 10% focusing on practicing, trying to achieve some kind of inner realization.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_24",
    "start": 304.973,
    "end": 313.204,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So therefore, Tibet produced not the world football champion, but the world kind of great spiritual masters.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_25",
    "start": 315.373,
    "end": 334.683,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So many of them came out of Tibet and came to come to West and we are very fortunate to meet them and receive teaching and some of you, many of you I think still continue to practice this precious lineage that we receive.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_26",
    "start": 339.882,
    "end": 347.812,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So, to tell you a little bit about Thabji Khyentse Rinpoche, maybe some of you didn't meet him,",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_27",
    "start": 350.393,
    "end": 355.335,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "younger people maybe heard about Rinpoche or read about Khenji Rinpoche.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_28",
    "start": 356.595,
    "end": 375.802,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So Khenji Rinpoche is one of these Tibet's great masters, among the many lamas, one of the great masters who studied with 50 different teachers from the four major schools of Tibetan Buddhism.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_29",
    "start": 377.338,
    "end": 387.407,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And then himself, not only study, but he put into practice by staying more than 20 years in cave and retreat, like that.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_30",
    "start": 388.448,
    "end": 398.597,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So Khen Rinpoche, somehow, when he left Tibet, he brought the precious lineage and all the teachings.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_31",
    "start": 400.719,
    "end": 401.4,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So nowadays,",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_32",
    "start": 402.573,
    "end": 417.298,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Recently I met one Tibetan researcher, he told me about this story of one of the Khen Rinpoche's teachers from the Gelug school, a very well-known Geshe.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_33",
    "start": 419.179,
    "end": 429.083,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And this Geshe, he has predicted that Khen Rinpoche's dharma activity will flourish one-third of the world.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_34",
    "start": 431.453,
    "end": 441.942,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I never heard that prediction before, it was just recently in Queens, Jackson Heights area, I heard this story.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_35",
    "start": 442.143,
    "end": 454.694,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So it's very true, I think everywhere we look, somehow Khyentse Rinpoche's lineage or teaching, and also Khyentse Rinpoche being a non-sectarian, I mentioned a little bit,",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_36",
    "start": 456.61,
    "end": 461.253,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "he had a responsibility of upholding all the four schools of Tibetan Buddhist tradition.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_37",
    "start": 462.434,
    "end": 474.801,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So he was very much, when you travel, he travelled since 1975, wherever he travelled he always tried to transmit whatever lineage or whatever tradition they follow.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_38",
    "start": 475.782,
    "end": 479.624,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Either it's from Gelug tradition, Saga tradition, then of course Nyingma and Khaji.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_39",
    "start": 481.13,
    "end": 488.915,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "whichever tradition they follow Rinpoche will teach according to their wishes and their kind of practice.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_40",
    "start": 488.955,
    "end": 500.643,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So Rinpoche sort of, I feel that Khyentse Rinpoche is like one of the main kind of life force, can I say, of the Buddha Dharma, especially the Tibetan Buddhist tradition in the world.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
