    "start": 502.344,
    "end": 509.349,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And some of, maybe for the young people, young children I see, if you like to know about Khyentse Rinpoche, he's physically very, very big.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
