    "end": 532.213,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "At one point, one young child came to Sri Rinpoche when he was a resident, and this child came with his mother, and when the child saw Khyentse Rinpoche, he was so fascinated that he told his mother, look, mummy, giant man, giant man.",
